==Trivia==
*Private Beach may have been designed specifically for [[Sakura Sonic (Uber Rare Cat)|Sacred Blade Sakura Z]], the [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]] alongside [[Resort De La Cospa]]. Sacred Blade Sakura Z is a dedicated [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal unit]] that can do [[Critical Hit]]s and is immune to [[Dark Dober]]'s Weaken, with a [[Talents|Talent]] that also makes her immune to its [[Mini-Wave]]s.

